#: ui/templates/core/about.html:62 ui/templates/core/home.html:19
msgid ""
"ChemEduTech is a digital platform that brings together the information "
"educational environment, chemistry subject content, pedagogical design and "
"artificial intelligence tools in the professional training of future "
"chemistry teachers."
msgstr ""

#: ui/templates/core/about.html:67
msgid ""
"On the platform a student not only masters chemical concepts but also "
"chooses digital resources for teaching them, organises research and virtual "
"experiments, prepares lesson materials, analyses the results and reflects on "
"his or her own teaching. The theoretical content of the platform follows the "
"chapters of the textbook «Pedagogical foundations of informatisation in the "
"training of chemistry teachers», its practical side — the materials of the "
"course «Methods of teaching chemistry»."
msgstr ""

